\">#7E4C1B92</span><span class=\"sep\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"separator dot\">·</span>21 Oct 2026, 01:05 pm</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"past-state\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-3\" data-name=\"order status and payment column\">\n<span class=\"status-chip chip-delivered\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"delivered status chip\"><span class=\"g\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon in chip\">✓</span> Delivered</span>\n<span class=\"payment\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"payment status\">Payment <strong data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"payment status value\">PAID</strong></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"past-total\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-4\" data-name=\"total amount display\"><span data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-4-1\" data-name=\"total amount label\">Total Amount</span><strong data-kid=\"2-3-5-1-4-2\" data-name=\"total amount value\">₹410</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"past-foot\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"past order footer\">\n<div class=\"items\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1\" data-name=\"ordered items row\">\n<div class=\"item\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"order item (Chole Bhature)\">\n<img alt=\"Chole bhature, photo by Yash Acharya on Pexels\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"item thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/11818239/pexels-photo-11818239.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<div class=\"item-name\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"item name block\"><span data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"item name text\">Chole Bhature</span><small data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"item quantity badge\">x2</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"order item (Gulab Jamun)\">\n<img alt=\"Gulab jamun, photo by Ali Dashti on Pexels\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"item thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/29259167/pexels-photo-29259167.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<div class=\"item-name\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"item name block\"><span data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"item name text\">Gulab Jamun</span><small data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"item quantity badge\">x2</small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-2\" data-name=\"order action buttons\">\n<button class=\"btn btn-details\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"view details button\" type=\"button\">View Details <i class=\"mdi mdi-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron right arrow icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-reorder\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"reorder button\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"re\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"refresh-rotate reorder icon\">↻</span> Reorder</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
