ata-name=\"view details button\" type=\"button\">View Details <i class=\"mdi mdi-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-4-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n<!-- 5. delivered -->\n<article class=\"rec\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5\" data-name=\"order record card with delivered status\">\n<div class=\"rec-body\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"order record body\">\n<div class=\"rec-meta\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"order record meta grid\">\n<div class=\"identity\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"restaurant identity block\">\n<img alt=\"Bikanervala, photo by Magda Ehlers on Pexels\" class=\"r-thumb\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"restaurant thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/32568165/pexels-photo-32568165.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=320&amp;q=80\"/>\n<div class=\"identity-text\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"restaurant identity text block\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"restaurant name heading\">Bikanervala</h3>\n<p class=\"oid\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"order ID number\">#7E4C1B92</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell-date\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"order date cell\"><span data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"order date value\">21 Oct 2026</span><span class=\"d-time\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"order time value\">01:05 pm</span></div>\n<div class=\"cell-state\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"order status cell\">\n<span class=\"badge delivered\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"delivered status badge\"><i class=\"mdi mdi-check\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"checkmark status icon\"></i>Delivered</span>\n<span class=\"pay\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"payment status line\">Payment <b data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"payment paid amount label\">PAID</b></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell-total\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-4\" data-name=\"order total cell\">\n<span class=\"t-label\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"total amount label\">Total Amount</span>\n<span class=\"t-value\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"total amount value\">₹410</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rec-items\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"order items and actions row\">\n<div class=\"items\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"ordered items list\">\n<div class=\"item\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"ordered menu item row\">\n<img alt=\"Chole bhature, photo by Yash Acharya on Pexels\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"item thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/11818239/pexels-photo-11818239.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"iname\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"item name text\">Chole Bhature</span>\n<span class=\"qty\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"item quantity text\">×2</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"item\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"ordered menu item row\">\n<img alt=\"Gulab jamun, photo by Ali Dashti on Pexels\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"item thumbnail image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/29259167/pexels-photo-29259167.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=200&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"iname\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"item name text\">Gulab Jamun</span>\n<span class=\"qty\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"item quantity text\">×2</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"order actions group\">\n<button class=\"btn ghost\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"view details button\" type=\"button\">View Details <i class=\"mdi mdi-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn reorder\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"reorder button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"mdi mdi-refresh\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-5-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"refresh reorder icon\"></i>Reorder</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-05T03:12:37.742427+00:00",
