ayment status text\">Payment <b data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"payment status value\">PAID</b></div>\n<div class=\"term-total\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3-2\" data-name=\"total amount display\"><span data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"total amount label text\">Total Amount</span><strong data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"total amount value\">₹410</strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"term-actions\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-4\" data-name=\"order action buttons row\">\n<button class=\"btn ghost\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-4-1\" data-name=\"view details outline button\" type=\"button\">View Details <i class=\"mdi mdi-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-4-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon in button\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn reorder\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-4-2\" data-name=\"reorder primary button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"mdi mdi-refresh\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-5-4-2-1\" data-name=\"refresh circle icon in button\"></i>Reorder</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
